--- operations/list-goals.md ---
# `listGoals`

`GET /goal/list`

Returns a page of goals for the calling actor.

Results are ordered newest first and paginated with an opaque cursor. Pass the
cursor from the previous page to continue; omit it to start from the beginning.

## Authentication

- [`ApiKeyAuth`](../authentication.md) (API key in header `X-API-Key`)

## Parameters

### Query

| Name | Type | Required | Default | Constraints | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `aggregation` | `string` | no |  |  |  |
| `cursor` | `string` | no |  |  |  |
| `page_size` | `string` | no |  |  |  |

## Responses

| Status | Body | Media types | Headers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `200` | [`ListGoalsOutput`](../schemas/list-goals-output.md) | `application/json` |  |  |

## Example

Each value is the example the API declares for it, or else one sampled from the schema, and satisfies every declared constraint. Credentials are placeholders — `{apiKey}`, `{token}`, `{base64(username:password)}` — and the code samples take them and the base URL as variables. Paths start at the server root; a server URL with a path prefix prepends it to every path.

### HTTP

```http
GET /goal/list?aggregation=gnr8&cursor=gnr8&page_size=gnr8 HTTP/1.1
x-api-key: {apiKey}
```

```http
HTTP/1.1 200
content-type: application/json

{
  "goals": [
    {
      "analyticsQuery": {
        "includePast": true,
        "metric": "gnr8",
        "windowDays": 7
      },
      "createdAt": "2024-01-02T03:04:05.123Z",
      "description": "gnr8",
      "metadata": {},
      "name": "gnr8",
      "targetDirection": "gte",
      "targetValue": 1.5,
      "uuid": "8f14e45f-ea69-4f6b-b2c1-9a1f4dcb1234"
    }
  ],
  "nextCursor": "8f14e45f-ea69-4f6b-b2c1-9a1f4dcb1234",
  "pageSize": 7,
  "total": 7
}
```

### Go — `example.com/goalservice/sdk`

```go
import (
	"fmt"

	"example.com/goalservice/sdk"
)

client := sdk.NewClient(baseURL, sdk.WithAPIKeyHeader("ApiKeyAuth", apiKey))
result, err := client.ListGoals(ctx, sdk.ListGoalsParams{Aggregation: sdk.Ptr[string]("gnr8"), Cursor: sdk.Ptr[string]("gnr8"), PageSize: sdk.Ptr[string]("gnr8")})
if err != nil {
	return err
}
fmt.Printf("%+v\n", result)
```

