- WARN: untyped query param 'page_size' on GET /list: read via c.Query with no binding struct; param type/required-ness under-specified, type inferred as string only (TARGET-API.md §5.4) (internal/goal/ports/handlers.go:47)
- WARN: untyped query param 'aggregation' on GET /list: read via c.Query with no binding struct; param type/required-ness under-specified, type inferred as string only (TARGET-API.md §5.4) (internal/goal/ports/handlers.go:48)
--- operations/update-goal.md ---
# `updateGoal`

`PUT /goal/{uuid}`

Replaces the mutable fields of one goal.

The goal is identified by its uuid. Fields omitted from the payload are left
unchanged; the goal's identifier and creation time are never modified.

## Authentication

- [`ApiKeyAuth`](../authentication.md) (API key in header `X-API-Key`)

## Parameters

### Path

| Name | Type | Required | Default | Constraints | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `uuid` | `string` | yes |  |  |  |

## Request body

Required: yes

| Media type | Schema |
| --- | --- |
| `application/json` | [`UpdateGoalInput`](../schemas/update-goal-input.md) |

## Responses

| Status | Body | Media types | Headers | Description |
| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |
| `200` | [`CommandMessage`](../schemas/command-message.md) | `application/json` |  |  |
| `400` | [`HttpError`](../schemas/http-error.md) | `application/json` |  |  |

## Example

Each value is the example the API declares for it, or else one sampled from the schema, and satisfies every declared constraint. Credentials are placeholders — `{apiKey}`, `{token}`, `{base64(username:password)}` — and the code samples take them and the base URL as variables. Paths start at the server root; a server URL with a path prefix prepends it to every path.

### HTTP

```http
PUT /goal/gnr8 HTTP/1.1
content-type: application/json
x-api-key: {apiKey}

{}
```

```http
HTTP/1.1 200
content-type: application/json

{
  "message": "gnr8"
}
```

### Go — `example.com/goalservice/sdk`

```go
import (
	"fmt"

	"example.com/goalservice/sdk"
)

client := sdk.NewClient(baseURL, sdk.WithAPIKeyHeader("ApiKeyAuth", apiKey))
result, err := client.UpdateGoal(ctx, "gnr8", sdk.UpdateGoalInput{})
if err != nil {
	return err
}
fmt.Printf("%+v\n", result)
```
